OL,3,APolice look for more than 100 gig-goers
OL,4,Ato help Co-op Live probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have said they are trying to
OL,7,Fcontact more than 100 gig-goers to help
OL,8,Ftheir investigation after an unknown
OL,9,Fsubstance was released at a concert at
OL,10,FManchester's Co-op Live arena.
OL,12,FDetectives believe a "small group of
OL,13,Forganised criminals targeted people in
OL,14,Fthe crowd to commit a series of
OL,15,Frobberies on the night".
OL,17,FMore than 12,000 people were evacuated
OL,18,Ffrom the arena during a performance by
OL,19,FUS rapper Don Toliver on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
