OL,3,ATurkish officials 'destroyed'
OL,4,Apro-opposition TV channel, owner tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FTurkish authorities have "destroyed"
OL,8,Fone of the country's most-watched news
OL,9,Fchannels, its London-based owner has
OL,10,Ftold the BBC.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the BBC's Newshour, Cafer
OL,13,FMahiroD_lu said that nine people
OL,14,Fconnected to Halk TV were arrested this
OL,15,Fweek on charges including money
OL,16,Flaundering, bribery and spreading
OL,17,Fmisleading information.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
